"Ease of Doing Business" means the Ease of Doing Business initiative of the Department of Industrial Policy and
Promotion, Government of India ;
(15)
"Enterprise" means a commercial unit engaged in manufacturing or processing or both, or in providing of any service as
defined from time to time under the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Development Act, 2006 (Central Act No. 27 of
2006) ;
(16)
"Government" means Government of Jammu and Kashmir ;
